    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the Shadows of a Dystopian Future</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307440/extras/913ae0c7ec3e4fcbb23b41dc25607754.avif?t=1750946555\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where humans and their shadows have been separated, the line between reality and despair is thin. Explore a dark and disturbing universe as Theo, a young man trapped in a cycle of apathy, discovers a new dimension of his own existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Living Shadows</i></strong> is a narrative-driven adventure with puzzles, where themes like anxiety, depression, and existential crises are intertwined in a captivating plot. Travel through a desolate city, mysterious areas, and solve puzzles as Theo confronts his shadow and the dark secrets of his family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307440/extras/d856848e587dbda94f401921e4f3c50d.avif?t=1750946555\" data-has-big width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307440/extras/30566303629c641f491a2e197f388bca.avif?t=1750946555\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sensitive themes such as mental health, anxiety, and the impact of technology on human life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and unravel mysteries as Theo explores his world, divided between light and shadow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with Theo's shadow, a symbol of his repressed fears and traumas, to progress through the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through dark and desolate environments that reflect the emotional state of the characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Theo, the mysterious Bituca, and other memorable characters who embody the internal and emotional struggles of a broken society.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and detailed 2.5D graphics that capture the essence of a dystopian and emotionally charged future.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307440/extras/63a661be73f74c55ed954dec67e2d32d.avif?t=1750946555\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307440/extras/d856848e587dbda94f401921e4f3c50d.avif?t=1750946555\" data-has-big width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Emotional Journey in a Dark World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307440/extras/47fdf56391c4d67962cd4616b496a28a.avif?t=1750946555\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment in <i><strong>Living Shadows</strong></i> reflects the internal chaos of its characters, creating an atmosphere that immerses the player in psychological and existential themes. The game combines narrative and puzzles, offering a provocative experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for an adventure that explores the limits of the human mind, <i><strong>Living Shadows</strong></i> is the perfect challenge, pushing you to confront the unknown and uncover hidden truths.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into the Shadows of a Dystopian Future</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307440/extras/913ae0c7ec3e4fcbb23b41dc25607754.avif?t=1750946555\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where humans and their shadows have been separated, the line between reality and despair is thin. Explore a dark and disturbing universe as Theo, a young man trapped in a cycle of apathy, discovers a new dimension of his own existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Living Shadows</i></strong> is a narrative-driven adventure with puzzles, where themes like anxiety, depression, and existential crises are intertwined in a captivating plot. Travel through a desolate city, mysterious areas, and solve puzzles as Theo confronts his shadow and the dark secrets of his family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307440/extras/d856848e587dbda94f401921e4f3c50d.avif?t=1750946555\" data-has-big width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307440/extras/30566303629c641f491a2e197f388bca.avif?t=1750946555\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore sensitive themes such as mental health, anxiety, and the impact of technology on human life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and unravel mysteries as Theo explores his world, divided between light and shadow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with Theo's shadow, a symbol of his repressed fears and traumas, to progress through the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through dark and desolate environments that reflect the emotional state of the characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Theo, the mysterious Bituca, and other memorable characters who embody the internal and emotional struggles of a broken society.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and detailed 2.5D graphics that capture the essence of a dystopian and emotionally charged future.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307440/extras/63a661be73f74c55ed954dec67e2d32d.avif?t=1750946555\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307440/extras/d856848e587dbda94f401921e4f3c50d.avif?t=1750946555\" data-has-big width=800 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Emotional Journey in a Dark World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307440/extras/47fdf56391c4d67962cd4616b496a28a.avif?t=1750946555\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each environment in <i><strong>Living Shadows</strong></i> reflects the internal chaos of its characters, creating an atmosphere that immerses the player in psychological and existential themes. The game combines narrative and puzzles, offering a provocative experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for an adventure that explores the limits of the human mind, <i><strong>Living Shadows</strong></i> is the perfect challenge, pushing you to confront the unknown and uncover hidden truths.</p>",
